      {
        "text": "Sara Hernandez is president of the Los Angeles Community College District board and an affordable housing advocate. She taught middle school in LAUSD, worked in Los Angeles City Hall, and practices as a housing and environmental attorney. She proposes a workforce housing tax credit for middle-income earners. She supports streamlining housing approvals and making duplexes and fourplexes more viable.",
